  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5003e22c990b3582",
      "translationZh": "AssetOpsBench 是一个综合性的基准测试与评估系统，涵盖六个定性维度，以工业资产全生命周期管理为起点，填补特定领域场景中智能体式 AI 的评估空白。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b605350bc0020952",
      "translationZh": "引言",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "790dce3ea0fe69c8",
      "translationZh": "现有 AI 基准测试虽然在编程或网页导航等单项任务上表现出色，却往往无法反映现实工业运营的复杂性。为弥合这一差距，我们推出了 AssetOpsBench，这是一个专门用于从工业应用的六个关键维度评估智能体表现的框架。与传统基准测试不同，AssetOpsBench 强调多智能体协同的必要性——超越“独狼”式模型，转向能够处理复杂故障模式、整合多个数据流并管理复杂工单的系统。通过聚焦这些高风险的多智能体交互，基准测试确保根据 AI 智能体应对真实工业环境中的细微差异和安全关键要求的能力，对其进行评估。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e04553d67705687b",
      "translationZh": "AssetOpsBench 专为冷水机组和空气处理机组等资产的运维而构建。它包括：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "15a4cc06e729af22",
      "translationZh": "2.3M 个传感器遥测数据点",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c232d51c466e46b6",
      "translationZh": "覆盖 4 个智能体的 140+ 个精心筛选的场景",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9f54858cff5f2be5",
      "translationZh": "用于不同场景的 4.2K 份工单",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9f6ad8eb119f1b58",
      "translationZh": "53 种结构化故障模式",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "37825444bc45661e",
      "translationZh": "专家协助精选了 150+ 个场景。每个场景都包含元数据：任务类型、输出格式、类别和子智能体。所设计的任务涵盖：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8b518d1a89fe40c5",
      "translationZh": "传感器数据流中的异常检测",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e0f02090b9e92b10",
      "translationZh": "故障模式推理与诊断",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f7f7bb65f73c836e",
      "translationZh": "KPI 预测与分析",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c23eb57a2a2baf88",
      "translationZh": "工单摘要与优先级排序",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7284a271ccf05506",
      "translationZh": "评估框架与总体反馈",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7f033c85ea3aa479",
      "translationZh": "AssetOpsBench 从六个定性维度评估智能体系统，这些维度旨在反映工业资产管理中的真实运营约束。该基准并非围绕单一成功指标进行优化，而是强调在数据不完整且含有噪声的情况下，决策轨迹的质量、证据依据、对故障的感知以及可操作性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fe6d0a931569bf73",
      "translationZh": "每次智能体运行都按六项标准评分：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "588c6e9737ae14ad",
      "translationZh": "任务完成情况",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9c8be745966177d3",
      "translationZh": "检索准确性",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c23bf95143a06ec0",
      "translationZh": "结果验证",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "18809bb75b5e94d8",
      "translationZh": "顺序正确性",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9df98e70f1ad63cd",
      "translationZh": "清晰度与理由说明",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8226516ff3541089",
      "translationZh": "幻觉率",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "580fb2ef4e6701a9",
      "translationZh": "在早期的各项评估中，我们观察到，许多通用智能体在表层推理上表现良好，但在涉及工单、故障语义和时间依赖关系的持续多步骤协调中却面临困难。显式建模运行情境与不确定性的智能体往往能产生更稳定、更具可解释性的执行轨迹，即使最终只完成了部分任务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c53bc821f1488e92",
      "translationZh": "这种以反馈为导向的评估是有意为之的：在工业场景中，理解智能体为何失败，往往比一个二元的成功信号更有价值。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3ca21024f2d122ea",
      "translationZh": "工业智能体工作流中的失效模式",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "396160497f61a8e8",
      "translationZh": "AssetOpsBench 的一项核心贡献，是明确将失效模式作为智能体工业工作流中的一等评估信号。AssetOpsBench 并不将失败视为二元结果，而是分析完整的多智能体执行轨迹，以识别在真实运行约束下，智能体行为在何处、以何种方式以及为何出现失效。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b7b28d9ac4face05",
      "translationZh": "AssetOpsBench 通过专门的轨迹级流水线（TrajFM）实现失效分析，该流水线结合基于 LLM 的推理与统计聚类，从智能体执行记录中揭示可解释的失效模式。该流水线分为三个阶段：（1）使用 LLM 引导的诊断提示进行轨迹级失效提取；（2）基于嵌入的聚类，将反复出现的失效模式分组；（3）通过分析与可视化，支持开发者反馈与迭代。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "226cb7f22c06f22c",
      "translationZh": "在各类工业场景中，反复出现的失效模式包括：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "111c18d57d8d390c",
      "translationZh": "传感器遥测数据、告警与历史工单之间不一致",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a240ff7251772c0e",
      "translationZh": "在证据缺失、延迟或不足的情况下，得出过度自信的结论",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2b932dd3966c70e2",
      "translationZh": "不同智能体对异构数据模态的聚合不一致",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "eedd9e35fcea40f2",
      "translationZh": "未经过充分的核查或验证步骤，便过早选择行动",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e7e74f00111992ce",
      "translationZh": "多智能体协调失效，例如忽略输入或行动与推理不匹配",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2fd985177e6b40e1",
      "translationZh": "重要的是，AssetOpsBench 并非仅依赖固定的、人工制定的失败分类体系。虽然系统使用一套结构化的预定义失败类别（例如验证错误、步骤重复、角色违规）来保持一致性，但其设计明确旨在发现实践中出现的新失败模式。由 LLM 识别出的其他失败模式会被自动进行嵌入表示和聚类，使分类体系能够随着对新智能体设计和行为的评估而演进。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d7094637bb11d0e1",
      "translationZh": "为保护工业机密，原始执行轨迹从不对外公开。智能体收到的是六个评估维度的汇总分数，以及经过聚类的失败模式摘要。这些摘要解释智能体为何失败，但不会泄露敏感数据或中间推理步骤。这种反馈驱动的设计使开发者能够诊断薄弱环节、优化智能体工作流，并通过迭代重新提交改进后的智能体。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "843673b3d23561f5",
      "translationZh": "这种关注失败的评估反映了工业资产管理的现实：谨慎、能考虑退化情况的推理，以及识别不确定性、推迟行动或适当升级处理的能力，往往比激进却脆弱的自动化更可取。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a1a16c5796a533f2",
      "translationZh": "提交智能体以供评估",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5db542ee16f4e65b",
      "translationZh": "AssetOpsBench-Live 被设计为开放、可用于竞赛的基准，我们欢迎社区提交智能体实现。智能体将在受控且保护隐私的环境中接受评估，该环境反映了真实工业资产管理中的约束。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "27b3fa7d9228a892",
      "translationZh": "提交智能体时，开发者首先使用所提供的模拟环境，在本地验证其实现。该环境包含具有代表性的传感器数据、工单、警报和失败模式目录。随后，智能体会被容器化并提交，以在隐藏的评估场景中远程执行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1ea4968951ada22c",
      "translationZh": "提交的智能体将按照一致、可复现的评估协议，在六个定性维度上接受评估：任务完成度、准确性、结果验证、行动顺序、清晰度和幻觉。执行轨迹不会对外公开；参与者收到的是汇总分数和结构化的失败模式反馈，指出智能体的推理或协调在哪些地方、因何失效。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "17e585ec19fffde5",
      "translationZh": "这一由反馈驱动的评估循环支持迭代改进：开发者可以诊断失败模式，优化智能体设计或工作流结构，并重新提交更新后的智能体以进行进一步评估。该框架同时支持侧重规划和侧重执行的智能体，使研究人员和实践者能够在同一基准测试框架内探索多样化的智能体设计。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a7e3852cfb0ec6ee",
      "translationZh": "实验与观察",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8551d6f318e1d8bd",
      "translationZh": "我们开展了一次社区评估，测试了两个方向：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3e9667f46724193b",
      "translationZh": "面向规划的多智能体编排",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cdb290defcd861f7",
      "translationZh": "面向执行的动态多智能体工作流。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cfb18d7ddadc1d57",
      "translationZh": "在涵盖 225 名用户、300+ 个智能体以及领先开源模型的评估中，我们观察到以下结果：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0de1acd2a3341d1d",
      "translationZh": "模型系列",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2e8008ee7456cb33",
      "translationZh": "最佳规划得分",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9e268b998db64cc1",
      "translationZh": "最佳执行得分",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "55b86136e6562704",
      "translationZh": "主要局限",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c4092b55b348de67",
      "translationZh": "在复杂工作流中虚构任务已完成",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ebacce94d006cfde",
      "translationZh": "难以处理多跳工具调用序列",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "45c12c8e485a6865",
      "translationZh": "未提出澄清问题（可修正）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f5eb00fcde36d623",
      "translationZh": "在多智能体协调过程中崩溃",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "25f8602ef00b28eb",
      "translationZh": "注：没有任何模型能够通过我们的评估标准基准测试并达到 85 分，而这是达到部署就绪状态的门槛。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f12c9586a0f4e0ba",
      "translationZh": "失败分布",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c0fdfe6909d4e4f2",
      "translationZh": "在 881 条智能体执行轨迹中，失败分布如下：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6df0b01cb8cdedc5",
      "translationZh": "错误恢复无效：31.2%",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "list-item",
