    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5b28098a7728d2f1",
      "translationZh": "忽略反馈：8.0%",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2a7ce3713eedc8d4",
      "translationZh": "其他：5.3%",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "115ba9c1c22d81ef",
      "translationZh": "除此之外，185 条执行轨迹中出现了一种新的失败模式，164 条中出现了多种新的失败模式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3181b0cb3660e0f5",
      "translationZh": "关键错误发现",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fc00cf7d64e0491a",
      "translationZh": "“听起来对，实际上错”：智能体声称已完成任务（23.8%），甚至在故障恢复未成功后仍输出成功结果（31.2%）。AssetOps 基准测试对于揭示这类问题很重要，以免操作人员依据错误信息采取行动。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b8e686369d788b59",
      "translationZh": "工具使用：这是高性能与低性能智能体之间最大的区别，顶尖智能体的工具使用准确率为 94%，而低性能智能体仅为 61%。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "88b8433e987cf77f",
      "translationZh": "多智能体使失败成倍增加：单智能体（68%）与多智能体（47%）的任务准确率对比，揭示了多智能体因上下文丢失、异步问题和级联失败而带来的复杂性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "444a32e6c4e5de94",
      "translationZh": "领域知识：能够访问故障模式数据库和维护手册的智能体表现更好。然而，RAG 知识并不总能得到正确使用，这表明需要结构化推理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b3d1c6f1b0376879",
      "translationZh": "歧义：传感器缺失、日志相互矛盾以及操作人员描述含糊，导致成功率下降了 34%。智能体必须内置澄清策略。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "860e628af803b137",
      "translationZh": "从哪里开始？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "989467017d5fdb16",
      "translationZh": "阅读我们的技术报告《AssetOpsBench：工业资产运营与维护中任务自动化 AI 智能体的基准评测》",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e0849f32be263716",
      "translationZh": "如何在本地运行 AssetOpsBench——视频《AssetOpsBench 本地执行》",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "71e5e3f2c283d276",
      "translationZh": "在 HuggingFace Space Playground 中试用 AssetOpsBench",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "694844d23e73ac40",
      "translationZh": "在 AssetOpsBench GitHub 上了解更多详情，复刻该仓库并开始使用。",
